WEBVTT

00:15.750 --> 00:16.440
Sir,

00:17.330 --> 00:18.280
have you seen

00:18.280 --> 00:19.650
an outsider with a beast-pattern tattoo?

00:19.650 --> 00:21.110
The tattoo is around here.

00:23.850 --> 00:25.040
What's wrong with him?

00:25.040 --> 00:26.170
That man is a bandit.

00:26.320 --> 00:27.510
He abducted the Mountain God's bride

00:27.510 --> 00:29.110
and committed a grave crime.

00:32.700 --> 00:33.230
Sit down.

00:38.500 --> 00:39.570
Tell me about it.

00:39.600 --> 00:41.060
What exactly was going on?

00:41.060 --> 00:42.330
Let me think whether I've seen him.

00:42.330 --> 00:43.790
He's just some pretty boy,

00:44.060 --> 00:45.790
actually quite good-looking.

00:45.860 --> 00:47.860
I don't buy that he's a bandit at all.

00:48.390 --> 00:50.320
He must be having an affair
with the bride.

00:50.320 --> 00:51.030
That's why she didn't want

00:51.030 --> 00:52.490
to marry the Mountain God.

00:52.890 --> 00:54.300
They must've slept together—

00:54.300 --> 00:55.500
two filthy bastards.

00:55.520 --> 00:56.530
Guys like him

00:56.840 --> 00:57.970
bring bad luck to their parents—

00:57.970 --> 00:59.170
born lowly and worthless.

00:59.170 --> 01:03.100
If we catch him, we'll castrate him
and parade him through the streets.

01:03.660 --> 01:04.989
Is the bride beautiful?

01:05.060 --> 01:06.140
She is.

01:06.660 --> 01:08.190
If she's untouched,

01:08.220 --> 01:09.460
taking her home as a concubine

01:09.460 --> 01:10.720
wouldn't be bad at all.

01:13.150 --> 01:13.730
Hey man,

01:14.010 --> 01:15.780
where did you come from outside?

01:15.780 --> 01:17.140
Where I come from—

01:17.930 --> 01:19.120
what's it to you?

01:23.130 --> 01:24.230
Just asking.

01:24.400 --> 01:25.180
Just asking.

01:25.200 --> 01:26.000
Casual chat.

01:26.030 --> 01:26.890
What about you?

01:27.800 --> 01:28.610
Local?

01:30.160 --> 01:31.020
Got a daughter?

01:33.690 --> 01:34.690
I have a daughter.

01:36.700 --> 01:37.789
How old is she?

01:38.640 --> 01:40.570
Has she reached marriageable age?

01:41.979 --> 01:44.410
About the right age to get married.

01:45.330 --> 01:47.190
When your daughter gets married,

01:47.830 --> 01:49.490
will she also take this route?

01:50.050 --> 01:52.310
Will she run into a bride kidnapping too?

01:52.880 --> 01:54.160
What do you mean?

01:58.080 --> 01:59.740
Have mercy! Please, spare me!

02:04.900 --> 02:06.280
Am I being too harsh?

02:06.280 --> 02:07.210
No, no, not at all.

02:07.210 --> 02:07.810
Not at all.

02:08.100 --> 02:09.380
Will you kill me then?

02:09.400 --> 02:10.330
I wouldn't dare.

02:10.410 --> 02:11.340
I wouldn't dare.

02:16.150 --> 02:18.680
Seems like I still haven't
been harsh enough.

02:29.190 --> 02:30.850
I wouldn't dare do that again.

02:37.860 --> 02:38.960
Sir, please spare me!

02:38.960 --> 02:39.930
Sir, please spare me!

02:39.930 --> 02:41.420
Sir, please spare me! Don't kill me!

02:41.420 --> 02:42.460
Don't kill me!

02:42.710 --> 02:44.210
Sir, please have mercy!
Please have mercy!

02:44.210 --> 02:45.870
Where is the Mountain God's
wedding taking place?

02:45.870 --> 02:46.650
Spare me!

02:47.530 --> 02:49.450
After you pass the mountain pass
and reach Xitou Beach,

02:49.450 --> 02:51.520
just follow the stream forward—

02:51.550 --> 02:53.350
that's the Mountain God Temple.

03:03.710 --> 03:04.560
Please, spare me!

03:04.560 --> 03:05.560
Please, spare me!

03:05.800 --> 03:06.300
Spare me.

03:06.300 --> 03:06.750
No, no—

03:09.100 --> 03:10.060
please, spare me!

03:10.060 --> 03:12.330
Sir, please spare me!
Sir, please spare me!

03:12.330 --> 03:13.250
Spare me, sir.

03:13.400 --> 03:14.380
Spare me, sir.

03:14.500 --> 03:15.490
Don't kill me!

03:15.690 --> 03:17.650
Spare me, sir. Spare me, sir.

03:17.670 --> 03:18.910
Spare me, sir.

04:45.890 --> 04:52.280
[Archives: The Nanyang Mystery]

04:52.570 --> 04:55.350
[Episode 28]

04:58.190 --> 05:00.720
This is the only way
into the Mountain God Temple.

05:00.720 --> 05:01.950
The bridal procession

05:01.950 --> 05:04.080
should be coming through here, right?

05:08.670 --> 05:09.470
They're here.

05:11.950 --> 05:14.210
Why is there no bride in this procession?

05:14.540 --> 05:15.680
Don't tell me

05:15.770 --> 05:17.130
that after what happened
between me and the bride earlier,

05:17.130 --> 05:18.690
they've hidden her away.

05:24.320 --> 05:25.850
Right now, the top priority

05:26.360 --> 05:27.770
is finding the bride.

05:28.190 --> 05:29.930
Let's go down and blend into the crowd

05:29.930 --> 05:31.260
and ask someone around.

05:32.470 --> 05:33.409
Help me!

05:33.240 --> 05:34.260
[Wulang Huazha, Local of Nanqiang]

05:33.430 --> 05:34.140
Help me!

05:39.060 --> 05:41.110
Quick, say you've caught the man
who abducted the mountain bride!

05:41.110 --> 05:43.970
I-I caught the man
who abducted the mountain bride!

05:46.780 --> 05:48.920
Do they not understand what you're saying?

05:48.920 --> 05:52.100
I said I've caught the man
who abducted the mountain bride—

05:52.100 --> 05:52.870
it's him!

05:54.159 --> 05:55.680
Ask who their leader is.

05:55.680 --> 05:56.770
Ask for a reward from them.

05:56.770 --> 05:58.170
I want to see your leader.

05:58.300 --> 05:59.760
Is there a reward for this?

06:08.280 --> 06:09.450
This is the man who abducted the bride.

06:09.450 --> 06:09.860
Yes, he is.

06:09.860 --> 06:10.920
He's a beggar from the mountains.

06:10.920 --> 06:12.260
Who are you calling a beggar?

06:12.260 --> 06:14.120
I'm a Daoist priest,
a legitimate cultivator.

06:14.120 --> 06:14.860
Tell them

06:14.860 --> 06:16.270
you were the bodyguard
I hired before,

06:16.270 --> 06:18.130
-To fulfill your duty...
-I... I...

06:18.130 --> 06:18.450
And then later you realized...

06:18.450 --> 06:18.890
I'm the bodyguard.

06:18.890 --> 06:20.800
-You got angry and caught me...
-He didn't pay me.

06:20.800 --> 06:21.190
So I arrested him.

06:21.190 --> 06:22.540
Do you think I'm deaf?

06:24.540 --> 06:25.810
Cut their hamstrings.

06:26.450 --> 06:29.040
Take them back
and leave them to the bride's families.

06:29.040 --> 06:30.180
Invoke the Patriarch!

06:30.180 --> 06:33.580
Five-fire orthodox law—
thunder spirit, ignite the flames!

06:41.310 --> 06:42.440
That's incredible!

06:46.240 --> 06:47.800
This guy can use sorcery!

06:48.300 --> 06:49.159
Zhang Qianjun,

06:49.690 --> 06:50.890
let's get out of here!

06:52.080 --> 06:53.700
We'll meet again!

06:57.900 --> 06:59.110
Boss, he got away!

06:59.740 --> 07:00.720
Sorcerer,

07:01.050 --> 07:03.600
are you just going to
abandon your companion like that?

07:03.600 --> 07:04.680
Actually, that little Taoist just now

07:04.680 --> 07:05.830
was just handling logistics.

07:05.830 --> 07:07.630
I'm the real professional here.

07:10.480 --> 07:12.170
Nobody move!

07:12.510 --> 07:13.070
Sir,

07:13.500 --> 07:14.400
we're just

07:14.870 --> 07:15.890
hired to do a job

07:15.910 --> 07:17.100
and earn a living.

07:23.220 --> 07:24.720
See? All thanks to me.

07:28.660 --> 07:29.400
Damn it!

07:32.000 --> 07:32.510
What?

07:33.070 --> 07:34.130
Yueshu is gone.

07:34.130 --> 07:36.790
You really don't know
where the bride is hidden?

07:37.450 --> 07:38.430
To be honest,

07:38.460 --> 07:40.860
I grew up with this bride
since we were kids.

07:41.390 --> 07:42.990
Bailejing hasn't been peaceful lately—

07:42.990 --> 07:44.050
there've been rumors

07:44.050 --> 07:45.909
that something in the forest
has been eating people.

07:45.909 --> 07:47.110
I came along this time

07:47.200 --> 07:48.640
to protect Yueshu.

07:49.570 --> 07:51.580
And you managed to lose her?

07:51.600 --> 07:52.960
The procession is so long

07:52.960 --> 07:54.720
that those in front thought
she was behind,

07:54.720 --> 07:56.830
and those behind
thought she was in front.

07:56.830 --> 07:58.030
If it weren't for you,

07:58.170 --> 07:59.690
we might not have
even noticed

07:59.690 --> 08:00.680
Yueshu was missing

08:00.680 --> 08:02.940
until we reached the Feikun Balu Temple.

08:03.880 --> 08:05.430
Did you see two men—

08:05.450 --> 08:06.570
one a Taoist,

08:06.600 --> 08:07.810
and the other a pretty boy?

08:07.810 --> 08:08.430
What?

08:08.580 --> 08:09.250
I'm asking you—

08:09.250 --> 08:10.770
have you seen two men?

08:12.320 --> 08:13.520
What's going on, sir?

08:13.760 --> 08:15.100
And where are the other group of men?

08:15.100 --> 08:16.130
The ones who were chasing me just now.

08:16.130 --> 08:18.130
I didn't see them in the procession.

08:18.630 --> 08:19.230
Follow me.

08:21.620 --> 08:23.200
The best way to hide someone

08:23.660 --> 08:25.460
isn't to conceal them in a crowd—

08:25.740 --> 08:28.720
but beneath lanterns
and the roar of drums.

08:29.050 --> 08:29.730
Found them.

08:45.550 --> 08:48.010
Then why is there
still another procession?

08:52.690 --> 08:53.890
Wait here for me.

09:21.280 --> 09:22.040
Don't be afraid.

09:22.040 --> 09:23.170
I'm here to save you.

09:26.770 --> 09:27.550
Mentor.

09:28.700 --> 09:29.600
Why is it you?

09:30.270 --> 09:31.330
Where's the bride?

09:31.540 --> 09:33.260
She was switched. Can't you tell?

09:33.260 --> 09:35.750
Do I really have to wait for you
to do everything?

09:35.750 --> 09:37.250
I'm the bride now.

09:37.740 --> 09:38.860
Get down, now.

09:39.240 --> 09:40.780
You're such a liability—

09:40.810 --> 09:42.240
how am I supposed to get married
with you in tow?

09:42.240 --> 09:43.100
Should I go too?

09:44.320 --> 09:45.300
Stay hidden.

09:46.180 --> 09:47.860
I'll handle things here.
Wait for my signal.

09:47.860 --> 09:48.500
Alright.

09:48.740 --> 09:49.340
I'm going.

09:57.650 --> 09:58.710
What's going on?

10:00.080 --> 10:01.880
What do you mean what's going on?

10:01.960 --> 10:03.080
That's my mentor.

10:04.600 --> 10:06.900
Some things are as inevitable as rain
or a mentor wanting to marry—

10:06.900 --> 10:07.700
just let it be.

10:09.120 --> 10:11.360
But that escort procession
is definitely suspicious.

10:11.360 --> 10:13.440
Those boxes are covered in talismans.

10:13.440 --> 10:15.600
They don't look like they're
meant for the living at all.

10:15.600 --> 10:18.610
Who would send off a living bride
with talismans all over?

10:18.610 --> 10:19.670
What about Yueshu?

10:20.220 --> 10:21.480
Could she be in danger?

10:21.820 --> 10:23.320
You care about her that much?

10:23.320 --> 10:25.250
You've still got feelings for her?

10:25.290 --> 10:26.150
No, no.

10:26.840 --> 10:28.320
We just grew up together.

10:30.840 --> 10:32.530
Well, this bride sure is quite the flirt—

10:32.530 --> 10:34.370
she's got the chief, and she's still
fooling around with other people.

10:34.370 --> 10:35.570
Don't talk nonsense.

10:35.910 --> 10:37.260
Yueshu is a good girl.

10:38.200 --> 10:40.570
If it weren't for her sick father
and younger brother,

10:40.570 --> 10:42.770
she wouldn't still be unmarried by now.

10:42.820 --> 10:44.820
Well, if you're that close with her,

10:44.840 --> 10:46.330
do you know our chief?

10:46.820 --> 10:47.840
Your chief?

10:55.760 --> 10:58.490
He has a tattoo on his chest,
something like this.

11:02.710 --> 11:04.310
I've been blind to the truth—

11:04.930 --> 11:06.060
with skills like yours,

11:06.060 --> 11:07.200
I should've known

11:07.690 --> 11:09.160
you're one of Feikun Balu's people.

11:09.160 --> 11:10.540
So if he really is some kind of deity,

11:10.540 --> 11:11.710
do you have a place here

11:11.710 --> 11:13.570
where Feikun Balu is worshipped?

11:13.630 --> 11:15.460
Yes, there are temples. Many temples.

11:15.460 --> 11:16.270
Feikun Balu Temple?

11:16.270 --> 11:17.130
Yes, yes.

11:18.480 --> 11:20.210
So would the bridal procession

11:20.770 --> 11:22.250
be heading to the Feikun Balu Temple?

11:22.250 --> 11:22.860
Yes.

11:23.090 --> 11:25.840
The bride will be sent
to the Feikun Balu Temple in Xigudong,

11:25.840 --> 11:27.860
where the priest
will preside over the wedding.

11:27.860 --> 11:29.290
The bridal procession won't stay—

11:29.290 --> 11:30.840
they'll continue on to Xigudong
for the Bone-Washing Ceremony.

11:30.840 --> 11:31.640
And the bride?

11:32.820 --> 11:33.870
The priest says

11:34.350 --> 11:36.310
the bride will remain
in the Feikun Balu Temple

11:36.310 --> 11:37.680
and serve the Mountain God.

11:37.680 --> 11:39.410
That is the honor of Bailejing.

11:39.790 --> 11:41.470
I thought the Zhang family was finished.

11:41.470 --> 11:42.330
I didn't expect

11:42.890 --> 11:44.940
the Zhang family
to still have a temple here.

11:44.940 --> 11:46.590
This chief is something.

11:47.290 --> 11:49.420
I hope he can save Mentor and Shrimpie.

11:49.700 --> 11:51.230
I've got an idea—follow me.

12:06.550 --> 12:09.210
Zhang Hailou,
don't say I'm not a loyal brother—

12:09.210 --> 12:10.340
I'm here to help you.

12:56.850 --> 12:58.140
Don't worry.

12:58.640 --> 13:00.610
It's just part of the ritual.

13:00.870 --> 13:03.210
[Su Li, High Priest of Bailejing]

13:01.210 --> 13:03.710
Feikun Balu will protect you.

13:04.790 --> 13:06.030
High Priest,

13:06.880 --> 13:07.450
what are

13:08.200 --> 13:09.930
these corpses

13:10.340 --> 13:11.840
being dug up for?

13:11.910 --> 13:14.340
To offer them to Feikun Balu.

13:15.370 --> 13:17.620
So you're saying I'm supposed
to be married off to Feikun Balu?

13:17.620 --> 13:18.860
What exactly

13:19.530 --> 13:20.770
is Feikun Balu?

13:21.100 --> 13:23.390
You'll see soon enough.

13:23.670 --> 13:24.340
Remember—

13:25.160 --> 13:26.730
when serving him,

13:26.750 --> 13:28.250
don't look him in the eye,

13:29.070 --> 13:31.950
unless you want to anger him.

13:39.130 --> 13:39.990
Now,

13:40.010 --> 13:42.890
is everything here
being done as a bridal ritual?

13:42.920 --> 13:44.180
Yes, High Priest.

13:44.620 --> 13:46.150
All we have to do is deliver
the bride and these corpses

13:46.150 --> 13:47.620
to the Feikun Balu Temple

13:47.650 --> 13:49.780
as offerings to the great Feikun Balu.

14:07.650 --> 14:08.220
Sir,

14:08.970 --> 14:09.830
what is this...

14:09.930 --> 14:10.860
No way like this.

14:10.930 --> 14:12.340
This shadow procession is too sinister.

14:12.340 --> 14:14.280
I need to get in there
to be with my mentor.

14:14.280 --> 14:15.370
With your build,

14:16.040 --> 14:17.640
you can just go in as a porter.

14:23.080 --> 14:25.610
I literally just
came through here, didn't I?

14:26.370 --> 14:28.250
Oh, Zhang Qianjun...

14:28.490 --> 14:30.220
You can even get lost like this?

14:31.170 --> 14:32.430
How useless can you be?

14:47.680 --> 14:48.630
Feng Huang?

14:49.310 --> 14:51.040
What are you doing lying there?

14:52.020 --> 14:53.100
Don't come over!

14:54.600 --> 14:55.220
Huh?

14:56.480 --> 14:57.460
Don't come over!

14:59.960 --> 15:02.220
Why do my legs feel so weak
all of a sudden?

15:02.250 --> 15:03.890
You idiot—

15:04.450 --> 15:05.910
what are you even good for?

15:06.600 --> 15:08.970
That's Nanqiang Horse-Stinger Grass.

15:09.000 --> 15:09.980
It's poisonous.

15:10.530 --> 15:11.990
How was I supposed to know?

15:12.710 --> 15:14.730
Is anyone there?

15:28.830 --> 15:29.970
Give me your hand.

15:40.550 --> 15:41.770
Are you stupid?

15:42.360 --> 15:44.530
If this grass is highly poisonous,

15:45.220 --> 15:46.800
you'd still come save me?

15:47.120 --> 15:49.120
Then why didn't you tell me earlier?

15:50.350 --> 15:53.410
Have you been staying
in the Taoist temple for too long?

15:53.900 --> 15:55.430
If I weren't kind-hearted,

15:55.840 --> 15:57.460
you'd already be dead.

15:58.410 --> 15:59.740
I attempted to save you—

16:00.010 --> 16:01.220
what did I do wrong?

16:02.910 --> 16:03.970
You're so capable,

16:04.580 --> 16:05.440
then tell me—

16:06.150 --> 16:07.810
what are we supposed to do now?

16:08.030 --> 16:10.270
Well, since you came to my rescue,

16:11.130 --> 16:13.530
let's head over and meet up
with my sister first.

16:13.530 --> 16:14.060
Let's go.

16:17.960 --> 16:19.100
You're okay now?

16:20.720 --> 16:21.500
I'm fine.

16:22.200 --> 16:23.270
People from the Zhang family

16:23.270 --> 16:24.580
are all in good health.

16:29.540 --> 16:30.860
Just like that?

16:30.960 --> 16:31.820
Let me help you.

16:54.780 --> 16:56.110
Are you sure about this—

16:56.700 --> 16:57.760
going for revenge?

17:02.030 --> 17:03.160
I've made up my mind.

17:03.790 --> 17:05.190
I'm going to get revenge.

17:05.460 --> 17:07.060
Don't try to talk me out of it.

17:07.569 --> 17:08.700
I'm not going to try.

17:11.030 --> 17:13.200
And I can't really understand
what you're going through,

17:13.200 --> 17:14.609
so I don't have the right

17:15.680 --> 17:16.740
to stop you either.

17:19.730 --> 17:20.839
Little Taoist,

17:21.310 --> 17:22.849
what happened—no more preaching?

17:22.849 --> 17:23.950
Did that toxic weed

17:24.460 --> 17:25.700
cure your yapping?

17:27.829 --> 17:30.160
I've spent my whole life
in the mountains,

17:31.050 --> 17:32.450
guarding a Taoist temple

17:33.440 --> 17:34.510
and a firework.

17:36.670 --> 17:38.530
I never had the chance to go out,

17:39.310 --> 17:40.660
to see what the outside world

17:40.660 --> 17:41.590
is really like.

17:42.250 --> 17:44.780
But honestly...
I've always wanted to see it.

17:45.480 --> 17:47.280
I want to come down the mountain,

17:48.530 --> 17:49.700
see the world,

17:51.480 --> 17:52.550
and find a firework

17:52.980 --> 17:54.420
that belongs to me.

17:59.440 --> 18:00.640
Sounds good.

18:01.970 --> 18:03.540
You go find your firework,

18:04.200 --> 18:05.530
I'll go take my revenge.

18:06.570 --> 18:07.770
If I die,

18:09.730 --> 18:11.450
just set off a firework for me—

18:12.010 --> 18:12.910
count it

18:13.290 --> 18:14.490
as visiting my grave.

18:19.140 --> 18:20.090
What's with the "mm-hmm"?

18:20.090 --> 18:21.900
Have you forgotten how to talk again?

18:21.900 --> 18:25.300
Why don't you go roll around
in that grass a couple more times?

18:26.120 --> 18:28.320
How are you feeling now? Let me help you.

18:49.910 --> 18:59.710
[Feikun Palu Temple]

19:05.130 --> 19:17.490
[Feikun Palu Temple]

19:20.550 --> 19:22.140
The auspicious hour is approaching.

19:22.140 --> 19:23.870
Prepare the wedding ceremony.

19:24.310 --> 19:26.590
Don't keep Feikun Balu waiting too long.

19:29.550 --> 19:30.660
Soon, you will

19:30.660 --> 19:32.900
be married to the great Feikun Balu

19:33.380 --> 19:34.980
and fulfill your destiny.

19:35.160 --> 19:36.250
Don't worry—your father
and younger brother,

19:36.250 --> 19:37.980
I will take care of them for you.

19:38.030 --> 19:39.720
I will take good care of them.

19:42.090 --> 19:43.930
If she's to marry Feikun Balu,

19:44.060 --> 19:46.010
then you're not allowed to touch her.

19:46.010 --> 19:48.070
This is my younger sister
who comes with me as part of the dowry.

19:48.070 --> 19:50.200
She will stand with me, no matter what.

20:02.880 --> 20:04.280
The stench of corpses...

21:20.660 --> 21:22.060
There are drag marks...

22:26.070 --> 22:28.190
What are you doing wandering around

22:28.550 --> 22:30.550
instead of taking care of the bride?

22:32.530 --> 22:33.400
Sir,

22:33.480 --> 22:35.180
I came out to find something to eat.

22:35.180 --> 22:37.380
We can't let the bride go hungry, can we?

22:42.120 --> 22:42.810
Sir,

22:43.430 --> 22:45.400
my sister is supposed
to be marrying a deity, right?

22:45.400 --> 22:46.990
Why is this place so eerie?

22:47.360 --> 22:50.620
It clearly looks like she's marrying
some kind of monster.

22:50.900 --> 22:51.750
Shh!

22:54.560 --> 22:55.430
Come here.

22:58.040 --> 22:59.800
A deity is a deity—

22:59.820 --> 23:01.020
don't talk nonsense.

23:06.180 --> 23:07.100
Miss,

23:07.250 --> 23:08.050
you

23:08.050 --> 23:09.380
don't need to be afraid.

23:09.640 --> 23:11.350
When the wedding ceremony starts,

23:11.350 --> 23:13.350
only your sister will be allowed in.

23:13.360 --> 23:15.890
Even if you want to,
you won't be allowed to enter.

23:15.890 --> 23:16.890
Just stay quietly

23:16.920 --> 23:19.610
in the room and wait.

23:19.750 --> 23:21.890
I'll make sure you...

23:34.390 --> 23:36.270
How did this thing end up here?

23:36.770 --> 23:38.970
Could everything be connected to this?

23:43.730 --> 23:45.690
Sir, come on, let me help you up.

23:49.000 --> 23:49.900
Sir,

23:50.030 --> 23:52.230
I see you're close with the High Priest.

23:52.380 --> 23:53.520
Tell me a bit more please.

23:53.520 --> 23:54.780
Let me learn a bit.

23:54.940 --> 23:56.780
What exactly is going on with
the mountain bride ritual

23:56.780 --> 23:58.190
in Bailejing?

24:06.900 --> 24:08.220
So you're saying

24:08.220 --> 24:11.070
Bailejing's so-called
"marrying the mountain bride"

24:11.070 --> 24:13.000
is actually a sacrificial ritual?

24:13.690 --> 24:15.620
And it's not the first time either.

24:16.530 --> 24:19.130
I found this in a crack
in the main hall doorway—

24:19.610 --> 24:20.870
Wanduo's fingernail.

24:23.070 --> 24:24.150
I looked into it.

24:24.870 --> 24:27.550
A few months ago,

24:27.750 --> 24:28.770
a major disaster broke out
deep in Nanqiang.

24:28.770 --> 24:31.510
Strange mist spread everywhere,
and many people died.

24:31.510 --> 24:33.420
The roads between
the six mountain settlements

24:33.420 --> 24:34.530
were completely cut off.

24:34.530 --> 24:35.550
Priest Su Ya

24:35.830 --> 24:36.980
then publicly claimed

24:36.980 --> 24:40.160
that someone had violated tribal taboos,

24:40.660 --> 24:42.240
triggering the catastrophe—

24:42.240 --> 24:43.550
and that things were still getting worse.

24:43.550 --> 24:44.700
Priest Su Ya,

24:44.850 --> 24:47.070
to prevent panic
from spreading through Bailejing,

24:47.070 --> 24:48.960
came up with this idea
of marrying the mountain bride.

24:48.960 --> 24:49.770
On the surface,

24:49.770 --> 24:51.500
it's meant to calm the people.

24:51.500 --> 24:52.740
In reality, it's used to cover up

24:52.740 --> 24:54.960
disappearances and deaths,

24:55.480 --> 24:58.010
and stop anyone
from investigating further.

24:58.290 --> 25:00.090
But one thing I can't figure out—

25:00.410 --> 25:02.210
why do they need so many corpses?

25:05.310 --> 25:06.380
Also, this thing

25:06.900 --> 25:07.680
and Mo Yungao

25:07.680 --> 25:09.660
have both suddenly appeared
in Nanqiang recently.

25:09.660 --> 25:10.680
Do you think this change

25:10.680 --> 25:13.210
has something to do
with Mo Yungao's arrival?

25:13.220 --> 25:14.020
My head hurts.

25:14.330 --> 25:15.590
I'm not the Director—

25:15.590 --> 25:16.420
why should I care?

25:16.420 --> 25:18.080
That's for you to think about.

25:23.610 --> 25:26.010
Right—so I'm the Director now, huh?

25:28.740 --> 25:31.540
Then of course
we'll turn their plan against them.

25:33.270 --> 25:35.310
Wait—what are you so worked up about?

25:35.310 --> 25:37.250
The last bride died such a horrible death.

25:37.250 --> 25:38.250
What, not pretty?

25:42.000 --> 25:43.660
You look drop-dead gorgeous.

25:46.590 --> 25:48.290
What happened to the original bride?

25:48.290 --> 25:49.750
She was already released.

25:49.940 --> 25:51.870
Nobody's going to stop my wedding—

25:52.180 --> 25:53.780
come on, help me get dressed.

26:14.500 --> 26:16.560
Yueshu, wait for me here for a moment.

26:27.200 --> 26:27.810
Move!

28:21.940 --> 28:22.580
Haiqi!

28:23.250 --> 28:24.680
I'm serious about you—

28:24.960 --> 28:26.580
come out and see me!

28:26.980 --> 28:27.880
Haiqi!

28:29.240 --> 28:30.920
I'm serious about you!

28:31.350 --> 28:32.140
Haiqi!

28:32.870 --> 28:34.530
Why are you looking for my mom?

28:35.770 --> 28:37.550
My dad isn't home today.

28:37.550 --> 28:39.500
Why don't you stay for a meal?

28:41.180 --> 28:42.640
Don't joke around.

28:42.660 --> 28:44.660
Miss Zhang isn't that kind of woman.

28:45.050 --> 28:46.720
You know what kind of woman

28:46.750 --> 28:48.090
she is better than anyone, huh?

28:48.090 --> 28:49.510
Flowers and gifts—

28:49.900 --> 28:51.030
we'll accept those.

28:51.250 --> 28:51.850
No.

28:51.990 --> 28:53.180
But as for seeing her in person,
that won't be necessary.

28:53.180 --> 28:54.550
I haven't even seen her yet.

28:54.550 --> 28:55.370
Go back.

28:55.520 --> 28:56.250
Go on, leave.

28:56.570 --> 28:57.440
How can you treat me like this?

28:57.440 --> 28:58.570
We won't see you out.

28:59.310 --> 29:00.710
Young Master, what do we do?

29:00.710 --> 29:02.180
What do you mean what do we do?

29:02.180 --> 29:02.710
Let's go.

29:03.510 --> 29:04.140
Goodbye.

29:10.980 --> 29:11.660
Mentor,

29:12.440 --> 29:14.070
this is already the third one today.

29:14.070 --> 29:15.220
Aren't you tired of it?
I'm getting sick of it.

29:15.220 --> 29:17.080
Why don't you just marry someone?

29:18.460 --> 29:19.530
Are you stupid?

29:20.010 --> 29:21.030
If she gets married,

29:21.030 --> 29:22.120
what happens to us?

29:22.140 --> 29:23.040
You're the stupid one.

29:23.040 --> 29:25.500
We'd just follow her
after she gets married.

29:27.530 --> 29:29.330
I'd rather live freely on my own.

29:29.440 --> 29:30.800
What do I need a man for?

29:32.000 --> 29:32.760
Besides,

29:33.380 --> 29:36.580
don't I already have you two
to take care of me in my old age?

29:43.600 --> 29:44.930
What are you looking at?

29:50.290 --> 29:52.620
I'm looking at how beautiful my mentor is.

29:57.020 --> 29:57.740
No,

29:58.720 --> 29:59.920
I don't like this one.

30:00.400 --> 30:02.800
I think the previous outfit looked better.

30:02.900 --> 30:04.100
This one looks great.

30:04.790 --> 30:05.690
I'm going to change.

30:05.690 --> 30:06.620
You go out first.

30:08.240 --> 30:09.380
But if I go out dressed like this,

30:09.380 --> 30:10.580
won't I blow my cover?

30:10.750 --> 30:13.330
Then find an empty latrine and hide in it.

30:16.270 --> 30:16.880
Fine.

30:17.490 --> 30:18.400
Just hurry up—

30:18.420 --> 30:20.080
don't keep everyone waiting.

31:21.720 --> 31:22.450
High Priest,

31:22.530 --> 31:24.310
after every ritual is completed,

31:24.310 --> 31:25.740
before Feikun Balu descends,

31:25.740 --> 31:27.270
Priest Su Ya  always leaves from here.

31:27.270 --> 31:29.060
What is this place inside?

31:29.270 --> 31:32.260
It seems to be a structure built
by people from a long time ago.

31:32.260 --> 31:34.460
Each time, Priest Su Ya goes deep inside

31:34.670 --> 31:36.050
and takes something before leaving.

31:36.050 --> 31:36.870
Could it be...

31:37.870 --> 31:39.570
the secret of Feikun Balu

31:40.320 --> 31:41.550
is hidden in here?

31:42.220 --> 31:44.240
High Priest,
the auspicious hour has arrived.

31:44.240 --> 31:44.830
Let's go.

33:35.860 --> 33:36.450
Mentor.

33:39.900 --> 33:40.400
Mentor.

33:42.810 --> 33:43.590
Hurry up—

33:46.920 --> 33:48.650
are you done yet? I'm coming in.

33:57.970 --> 33:59.960
You're running away at a time like this?

33:59.960 --> 34:00.700
Seriously?

34:01.440 --> 34:02.350
Bride,

34:02.440 --> 34:03.350
hurry up.

34:03.350 --> 34:04.350
Are you ready yet?

34:09.969 --> 34:11.170
Come on—are you done?

34:12.230 --> 34:13.030
Why are you rushing me

34:13.030 --> 34:14.060
so much?

34:14.260 --> 34:16.050
Are you in a hurry
to be reborn or something?

34:16.050 --> 34:17.710
Let's go. Time to get married.

37:42.820 --> 37:44.080
It's the Zhang family.

37:45.770 --> 37:48.440
So the source of the resurrection drug
really is Nanqiang—

37:48.440 --> 37:51.040
and it comes
from the Zhang family themselves.

37:52.830 --> 37:56.560
They were trying to use this medicine
to bring the dead back to life.

38:00.150 --> 38:02.110
But how could the Zhang family

38:02.110 --> 38:04.840
develop something like this
in a place like this?

38:05.510 --> 38:07.770
What exactly is hidden deep in Nanqiang?

38:17.010 --> 38:18.940
They actually came back to life...

38:20.660 --> 38:22.320
But these resurrected people

38:22.690 --> 38:24.260
don't seem normal.

38:25.110 --> 38:28.310
These deranged people
took another dose of the medicine,

38:28.530 --> 38:30.380
and they seem to have returned to normal.

38:30.380 --> 38:31.510
If that's the case,

38:32.840 --> 38:36.300
there must be something here
that can restore people to normal.

38:36.300 --> 38:37.820
Where is that medicine?

38:45.120 --> 38:45.850
These...

38:46.500 --> 38:49.500
are the medicinal materials
used to refine that drug.

38:54.130 --> 38:55.230
A cliff...

39:09.590 --> 39:10.630
So that's it...

39:11.400 --> 39:14.130
they use Zhang family blood
to make the medicine.

39:30.500 --> 39:32.560
So this is what's hidden deep inside.

39:34.320 --> 39:35.550
Then Zhang Haixia might also...
